<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czechs announce bid terms for Aero stake.</title>
<headline>Czechs announce bid terms for Aero stake.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bidders in a tender for a 34 to 40 percent stake in Czech aircraft maker Aero Vodochody a.s. must offer a mimimum of 950 million crowns for the shares, Industry and Trade Minister Vladimir Dlouhy said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He told a news conference that the tender, open to domestic and foreign concerns seeking to revitalise the troubled jet aircraft firm, would be officially opened around January 20.</p>
</text>
